      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:13.180" end="00:17.070" ttm:agent="v1">We got bad habits, bad habits</p>
      <p begin="00:17.070" end="00:20.050" ttm:agent="v1">You smoke, I drink what is there to say?</p>
      <p begin="00:20.050" end="00:23.760" ttm:agent="v1">You're my bad habit, bad habit</p>
      <p begin="00:23.760" end="00:26.960" ttm:agent="v1">You smoke, I drink what is there to say?</p>
      <p begin="00:26.960" end="00:30.750" ttm:agent="v1">We got bad habits, bad habits</p>
      <p begin="00:30.750" end="00:33.760" ttm:agent="v1">You smoke, I drink what is there to say?</p>
      <p begin="00:33.760" end="00:37.520" ttm:agent="v1">You're my bad habit, bad habit</p>
      <p begin="00:37.520" end="00:41.290" ttm:agent="v1">You smoke, I drink what is there to say?</p>
      <p begin="00:41.290" end="00:44.630" ttm:agent="v1">I saw you standing in your room with a cigarette</p>
      <p begin="00:44.630" end="00:47.360" ttm:agent="v1">You're coping with a heavy blunt smoking out your neck</p>
      <p begin="00:47.360" end="00:51.250" ttm:agent="v1">But I can't blame ya I got problems like</p>
      <p begin="00:51.250" end="00:54.690" ttm:agent="v1">You got smoke in your lungs I got them like</p>
      <p begin="00:54.690" end="00:57.540" ttm:agent="v1">Cigarettes and alcohol</p>
      <p begin="00:57.540" end="01:00.920" ttm:agent="v1">They go very well compatible</p>
      <p begin="01:00.920" end="01:05.040" ttm:agent="v1">Just like cigarettes and alcohol</p>
      <p begin="01:05.040" end="01:07.810" ttm:agent="v1">You and me compatible</p>
      <p begin="01:07.810" end="01:11.190" ttm:agent="v1">Cause I'll light your light if you pour my cup</p>
      <p begin="01:11.190" end="01:14.680" ttm:agent="v1">It don't matter what they say cause they don't know none</p>
      <p begin="01:14.680" end="01:18.130" ttm:agent="v1">You're my cigarette to my alcohol</p>
      <p begin="01:18.130" end="01:22.310" ttm:agent="v1">You're my cigarette to my alcohol</p>
      <p begin="01:22.310" end="01:30.310" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:35.430" end="01:38.530" ttm:agent="v1">I spent half my heart on arguments</p>
      <p begin="01:38.530" end="01:42.110" ttm:agent="v1">My other half got robbed can't get it back</p>
      <p begin="01:42.110" end="01:45.690" ttm:agent="v1">So don't ask me how I feel I can't</p>
      <p begin="01:45.690" end="01:48.920" ttm:agent="v1">I am numb inside and I'll break my neck</p>
      <p begin="01:48.920" end="01:52.130" ttm:agent="v1">I spent half my heart on arguments</p>
      <p begin="01:52.130" end="01:55.880" ttm:agent="v1">My other half got robbed can't get it back</p>
      <p begin="01:55.880" end="01:59.250" ttm:agent="v1">So don't ask me how I feel I can't</p>
      <p begin="01:59.250" end="02:03.420" ttm:agent="v1">I am numb inside and I'll break my neck</p>
      <p begin="02:03.420" end="02:06.130" ttm:agent="v1">Cigarettes and alcohol</p>
      <p begin="02:06.130" end="02:09.680" ttm:agent="v1">They go very well compatible</p>
      <p begin="02:09.680" end="02:13.700" ttm:agent="v1">Just like cigarettes and alcohol</p>
      <p begin="02:13.700" end="02:16.300" ttm:agent="v1">You and me compatible</p>
      <p begin="02:16.300" end="02:19.840" ttm:agent="v1">Cause I'll light your light if you pour my cup</p>
      <p begin="02:19.840" end="02:23.260" ttm:agent="v1">It don't matter what they say cause they don't know none</p>
      <p begin="02:23.260" end="02:26.670" ttm:agent="v1">You're my cigarette to my alcohol</p>
      <p begin="02:26.670" end="02:30.900" ttm:agent="v1">You're my cigarette to my alcohol</p>
      <p begin="02:30.900" end="02:38.900" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:44.090" end="02:47.120" ttm:agent="v1">If you need some lungs then I got you</p>
      <p begin="02:47.120" end="02:51.080" ttm:agent="v1">But if my liver fails do you got me?</p>
      <p begin="02:51.080" end="02:57.380" ttm:agent="v1">If you'd come real close with that cigarette you might burn my heart up inside me</p>
      <p begin="02:57.380" end="03:00.670" ttm:agent="v1">If my heart beats for you</p>
      <p begin="03:00.670" end="03:04.330" ttm:agent="v1">Does your heart beat for me?</p>
      <p begin="03:04.330" end="03:07.530" ttm:agent="v1">If you'd open my heart</p>
      <p begin="03:07.530" end="03:11.940" ttm:agent="v1">I could be your nicotine</p>
      <p begin="03:11.940" end="03:14.580" ttm:agent="v1">Cigarettes and alcohol</p>
      <p begin="03:14.580" end="03:17.960" ttm:agent="v1">They go very well compatible</p>
      <p begin="03:17.960" end="03:22.100" ttm:agent="v1">Just like cigarettes and alcohol</p>
      <p begin="03:22.100" end="03:25.080" ttm:agent="v1">You and me compatible</p>
      <p begin="03:25.080" end="03:28.530" ttm:agent="v1">Cause I'll light your light if you pour my cup</p>
      <p begin="03:28.530" end="03:31.870" ttm:agent="v1">It don't matter what they say cause they don't know none</p>
      <p begin="03:31.870" end="03:35.410" ttm:agent="v1">You're my cigarette to my alcohol</p>
      <p begin="03:35.410" end="03:39.580" ttm:agent="v1">You're my cigarette to my alcohol</p>
      <p begin="03:39.580" end="03:43.580" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
